  "worked_solution": "To evaluate the minor of ${f}_{13},$ we remove the first row and third column: \n\n$$\nF=[\\begin{aligned}\u2217 & \u2217 & -2 \\\\ 3 & v & \u2217 \\\\ 5 & 6 & \u2217\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor of ${f}_{13}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{13} & =det[\\begin{aligned}3 & v \\\\ 5 & 6\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & v \\\\ 5 & 6\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\cdot 6-v\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =18-5v\\end{aligned}\n$$",
